Bundled Bible texts

core/src/main/resources/bible/RST.SQLite3 (Russian Synodal translation, 1876)
and KJV.SQLite3 (King James Version, 1769 edition) are public domain texts.
Text source: scrollmapper/bible_databases (https://github.com/scrollmapper/bible_databases,
MIT License); converted to MyBible format by tools/bible/make_modules.py.


Bundled fonts

android/receiver/src/main/res/font: Carlito and Caladea (Google, metric-compatible
with Calibri and Cambria) and Liberation Sans (Red Hat, metric-compatible with Arial),
all under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. They are used by the built-in PPTX to PDF
conversion so that lines break where PowerPoint breaks them.


Bundled FFmpeg (desktop)

The desktop installers include FFmpeg libraries packaged by the Bytedeco JavaCPP Presets
(org.bytedeco:ffmpeg, https://github.com/bytedeco/javacpp-presets; JavaCPP is Apache-2.0).
That FFmpeg build is configured with --enable-version3 and without --enable-gpl or
--enable-nonfree, so it is licensed under the GNU LGPL version 3 or later. Source code:
https://ffmpeg.org and the javacpp-presets repository. It decodes the phone's screen
broadcast with low latency (the same approach as scrcpy; no scrcpy code is used).


AirPlay receiver (rewritten from UxPlay)

core/src/main/kotlin/app/deixis/core/airplay/ is a Kotlin rewrite of the AirPlay mirroring
receiver in UxPlay (https://github.com/FDH2/UxPlay), which is licensed under the GNU GPL
version 3. The protocol handling, pairing, stream decryption and FairPlay key exchange follow
these UxPlay files:
  lib/raop.c, lib/raop_handlers.h, lib/raop_rtp_mirror.c, lib/mirror_buffer.c, lib/raop_ntp.c,
  lib/pairing.c, lib/dns_sd/dns_sd.c, lib/dnssdint.h, lib/global.h, lib/fairplay_playfair.c
    UxPlay: Copyright (C) F. Duncanh and the UxPlay contributors (GPL-3.0)
    RPiPlay: Copyright (C) 2019 dsafa22, Florian Draschbacher (LGPL-2.1-or-later)
    shairplay: Copyright (C) 2011-2012, 2018 Juho Vähä-Herttua (LGPL-2.1-or-later)
    Jaslo Ziska, 2020 (LGPL-2.1-or-later)
  lib/playfair/*.c (FairPlay "playfair" module, by EstebanKubata; GPL-3.0)
    -> FairPlay.kt and FairPlayTables.kt; the constant tables are data taken from playfair,
       verified against the unmodified C code by FairPlayTest.
All these licences are compatible with GPL-3.0-or-later. The rewrite is not part of the
Google Play build (gradle property deixis.store=play turns it off). AirPlay, iPhone, iPad and
Mac are trademarks of Apple Inc.; Deixis is not affiliated with or endorsed by Apple.

Bouncy Castle (org.bouncycastle:bcprov-jdk18on, MIT-style Bouncy Castle Licence) provides
Ed25519 and X25519 for AirPlay pairing.
